{"type":"assistant","message":{"content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The clones were created:\n- Photo_Profile: 5:2 (228×320)\n- Icon_Arrow_Down: 5:3 (24×24)\n- Icon_Arrow_Right: 5:5 (24×24)\n- Icon_Arrow_Up_Right: 5:7 (24×24)\n- Title text: 5:9\n\nAll are <symbol> type = COMPONENT masters. \n\nNow build the NavLink and TextLink component sets with hover wiring. Since code return values don't come back, I'll need to use get_metadata to discover created IDs after each call.\n\nLet me write Call B: NavLink (4 variants) + TextLink (6 variants) with hover interactions.\n\nKey structure:\n- NavLink variants: Current=No/Yes × State=Default/Hover. Text \"Work\" 16 Medium lh24, padding TB 6.\n- TextLink variants: Icon=None/ArrowRight/ArrowUpRight × State=Default/Hover. Text \"Link label\" 16 Medium accent lh24, icon 16px accent.\n\nIcon rescale: try inst.rescale(16/24) catch fallback resize.\n\nFor recoloring icon instances to accent: iterate fills.\n\nPositions before combine:\n- Nav: x = 0, 160, 320, 480, y = 80\n- TextLink: x = 0, 200, 400, 600, 800, 1000, y = 200\n\nAfter combineAsVariants, set position.\n\nHover wiring: reactions on variant masters.\n\nOne thing to be careful about: combineAsVariants(nodes, parent, index). Signature: figma.combineAsVariants(nodes, parent, index). Parent ws.\n\nLet me write the code.","signature":"730def3af15e4ac69e9618f0"}],"id":"081d57bc-b9f6-4418-b3ea-09a2d9dd43e2","model":"glm-5.3-flash","role":"assistant","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"type":"message","usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"89a64135-6412-4ef4-999c-ac66165ec06a","uuid":"f7449862-d16d-4ffb-a3cb-2dc079e4018e","timestamp":"2026-11-02T01:33:52.426Z","thinking_duration_ms":8144}
