{"type":"assistant","message":{"content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Header: 8:6 (1440×89), Footer: 8:19 (1440×94). \n\nNow Call D: Image Placeholder component + Skill List component + Project Block set (Link/Status variants).\n\nImage Placeholder:\n- 660×440, HORIZONTAL, center/center, fill #EDEAE6, child \"Image placeholder\" 13 Medium muted.\n\nSkill List:\n- VERTICAL, width 624 FIXED, hug height\n- TitleWrap: padding bottom 20, child title 12 Medium ls 8% muted \"Main Software\"\n- Rows: Row1..Row6, each RowWrap frame VERTICAL padding 14 0 with text 16 Regular ink lh 26 (stretch), Dividers between.\n\nWait — for width 624 fixed on component: counterAxisSizingMode=\"FIXED\" then resize(624, height). Children text stretch.\n\nText in RowWrap: text stretch width → textAutoResize=\"HEIGHT\", layoutAlign=\"STRETCH\".\n\nProject Block:\n- Link variant \"CTA=Link\": HORIZONTAL gap 64, counterAlign MIN; col 556 fixed; nameRow baseline (num 64 Bold ghost #DDD9D4, slash 26 Medium muted, name 26 Medium ink lh34); desc 16/26 secondary stretch; tools 14/22 muted stretch; link instance 7:23.\n- Status variant \"CTA=Status\": badge instead of link.\n- Image placeholder instance 660×440.\n\nFor counterAxisAlignItems=\"MIN\" the image top aligns with content col top.\n\nText naming: \"Number\", \"Slash\", \"Name\", \"Description\", \"Tools\", \"Badge\", link instance name \"CTA Link\".\n\nBadge: HORIZONTAL AUTO, padding 8 16, cornerRadius 999, fill subtle #F6F4F1, text \"Project WIP\" 12 Medium secondary ls 4.\n\nPositions: placeholder at (0,620); project blocks at (720,620) and (720+1320=2040? Too wide next to placeholder (660 wide → ends 660). Place Link at (720,620), Status at (720,1140)? Link block height ~440. Hmm block height = max(text col ~330, image 440) = 440. Place Status at (720,1120). Then Skill Lists at (0,1120) and (690,1120)? placeholder ends at y=620+440=1060. OK SkillList1 (0,1120), SkillList2 (690,1120) each 624 wide → ends 1314. Fine.\n\nThen combineAsVariants for project blocks: they're at different positions; combine keeps relative positions; then I reposition the set to (720,620)? After combine the set encloses both; I'll set set.x=720, set.y=620. But variants inside will be at their relative positions (vertical offset). That's fine — set arranges.\n\nHmm wait, if Link at (720,620) and Status at (720,1120) — vertical stacking with 60px gap. combineAsVariants positions variants as laid out. OK.\n\nActually — simpler: create Link at (0,0)-ish positions relative... I'll just create Link comp at x=720,y=620 and Status at x=720,y=1120, then combine, then set position (720,620).\n\nImage placeholder instance inside blocks: default 660×440.\n\nOne concern: mkText with ls percent 8 for title.\n\nLet me also design SkillList component name \"Skill List\".\n\nDivider rects in SkillList: height 1, fill divider, layoutAlign STRETCH.\n\nStructure SkillList children: TitleWrap, Row1, Div, Row2, Div, Row3, Div, Row4, Div, Row5, Div, Row6. itemSpacing 0. RowWrap padding: top 14 bottom 14.\n\nTitle \"Main Software\" muted 12 Medium ls 8% lh 16. TitleWrap padding bottom 20.\n\nHmm — also add a divider right under title? Keep clean without.\n\nRows text name \"Item\".\n\nRow text default: \"Pixologic ZBrush\" etc. Actually component defaults should be the Software list (6 items):\n1. Pixologic ZBrush\n2. Autodesk Maya\n3. The Foundry Mari\n4. Arnold Renderer\n5. Blender\n6. Forger · Adobe CC, Figma, Ableton\n\nProject block defaults (Goblin Bust data).\n\nCode Call D. Also define ghost color GHOST={r:221/255,g:217/255,b:212/255} (#DDD9D4).\n\nLet me write it.","signature":"4276df3f2711400596e4f532"}],"id":"c70068ef-f54a-4877-b342-6098907d1c9b","model":"glm-5.3-flash","role":"assistant","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"type":"message","usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"89a64135-6412-4ef4-999c-ac66165ec06a","uuid":"113adc81-8b92-41b6-9e52-381541c8c92