an add interactions to instance children (they show as overrides). Hmm, but via API?\n\nEnough speculation — empirical test in ONE call with proper DISSOLVE transitions and immediate read-backs:\n1. cue.reactions = [click DISSOLVE...]; read back.\n2. nav child reactions = [click DISSOLVE...]; read back.\n3. plain rect reactions = [click DISSOLVE]; read back; remove rect.\nWrite results to debug node; screenshot debug.\n\nThen decide. Let me write this test.","signature":"12dfa9cfecb64b2c82fdd90f"}],"id":"1c8c6add-85ae-4b02-9271-d5dabb5b32fe","model":"glm-5.3-flash","role":"assistant","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"type":"message","usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"89a64135-6412-4ef4-999c-ac66165ec06a","uuid":"25f3f5ad-e2e2-4529-992b-b1a55bec17e8","timestamp":"2026-11-02T01:54:44.956Z","thinking_duration_ms":120063}
